2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["環境舒適，帶有日式的質感，整體清爽明亮，麵類湯頭濃郁，但整體略微偏鹹，炸雞塊熱騰騰的享用，外酥內嫩很不錯，海苔叉燒飯像是滷肉飯，雖然偏油但很香醇，胡麻青菜比較可惜，胡麻醬提早淋上後再冰過，口感受影響，最好是上桌前再淋醬，沖繩黑糖綠蕨餅很爽口，夏天品嚐非常棒~整體表現滿意，但驚艷程度還好，偶爾可以來吃~",null,[0,151]]]],[null,1779674287000000,1779674287000000,"3 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfOWJmOFRJbEJzWEVwNlJGaEdPX21kQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfOWJmOFRJbEJzWEVwNlJGaEdPX21kQRoTQ2d3SXI5bk8wQVlRdmRiWXhBRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiFmfqPydKWAxXRcfUHHclXGXcQ_2MI1wEoDA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4246590786394757759/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhV2xkV1pHaFpiRWt5Wlcxa2NtSXhSa3hXYlRWQ1dsaFdWV1JZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4246590786394757759/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhV2xkV1pHaFpiRWt5Wlcxa2NtSXhSa3hXYlRWQ1dsaFdWV1JZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4246590786394757759/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhV2xkV1pHaFpiRWt5Wlcxa2NtSXhSa3hXYlRWQ1dsaFdWV1JZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4246590786394757759/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhV2xkV1pHaFpiRWt5Wlcxa2NtSXhSa3hXYlRWQ1dsaFdWV1JZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4246590786394757759/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhV2xkV1pHaFpiRWt5Wlcxa2NtSXhSa3hXYlRWQ1dsaFdWV1JZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4246590786394757759/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhV2xkV1pHaFpiRWt5Wlcxa2NtSXhSa3hXYlRWQ1dsaFdWV1JZWXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["親愛的顧客您好，感謝您的評論，感謝您能留言讓我們了解不如預期之處，我們會致力於提供更好的餐點與服務，期待您下次光臨！再次感謝您的回饋，祝您順心。",null,[0,72]]]],[null,null,477,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25aWldWZGhZbEkyZW1kcmIxRkxWbTVCWlhWVWRYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0